  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="649c7295-dab9-51e4-bf12-05906e7f7fed" activityNameId="226434ea-4ba4-522e-855e-63be1d05bfeb" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Selective coating, copper sheet, black chrome</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Selective coating, copper sheet, black chrome
Inventory for selective coatings of solar absorbers. For black chrome and black nickel the solar absorbance is a=0.91~0.98 and thermal emittance is e=0.06~0.14.;
Synonyms: KROSOL; 
UUID: 36fc6adf-4053-3d12-a0dc-c1477c2fa3f4
Gate to gate inventory for the process including infrastructure, wastes, effluents. Not including packages. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Black chrome coating with nickel underlay. Alkaline cleaning of copper to remove any oils on the surface. Neutralizing with the acid to remove any oxidation. Plating nickel on copper. Plating black chrome on the nickel plated copper. Wash and dry.
Time period: Data for the production in these years.
Production volume: 8Mio m2 in about 30a by one company. Annual production about 500000 m2.
Sampling: Personal communication and public information 
Extrapolations: Data for 2 out of 3 companies. Assessment with European electricity mix.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_36fc6adf-4053-3d12-a0dc-c1477c2fa3f4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">RER</shortname>
        <comment>
